@startuml
title idempotent-component v2 - Runtime State View

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

' 这张图用于“快速看懂运行态”，不替代 00-idempotency-full-state.puml。
' 颜色只用于区分语义层次，不代表代码中的额外状态。

legend
|= 颜色 |= 含义 |
|<#D9EAF7>| PROCESSING / 执行中 |
|<#DFF2BF>| SUCCESS / 成功终态 |
|<#FDE9A9>| FAILED / 失败终态 |
|<#E6E6E6>| DISCARDED / 丢弃终态 |
|<#FFF4CC>| 派生判定状态 |
|<#E8DDF5>| Recovery / 接管流程 |
endlegend

state "ABSENT\n[DOC ONLY]\n尚无记录" as ABSENT #FFFFFF
state "PROCESSING\n[PERSISTED]\nownerToken + version\nprocessingExpireAt" as PROCESSING #D9EAF7
state "SUCCESS\n[PERSISTED]\n业务真实成功" as SUCCESS #DFF2BF
state "FAILED\n[PERSISTED]\nfailureRetryable" as FAILED #FDE9A9
state "DISCARDED\n[PERSISTED]\n明确终止，不再处理" as DISCARDED #E6E6E6

[*] --> ABSENT
ABSENT --> PROCESSING : [NORMAL] tryAcquire=ACQUIRED\nowner=A, version=1
PROCESSING --> SUCCESS : [WRITE] markSuccess\nowner/version CAS=UPDATED
PROCESSING --> FAILED : [WRITE] markFailed\nowner/version CAS=UPDATED
PROCESSING --> DISCARDED : [WRITE] markDiscarded\nowner/version CAS=UPDATED

state "PROCESSING_ACTIVE\n[DERIVED]\nlease 未过期" as ACTIVE #FFF4CC
state "PROCESSING_EXPIRED\n[DERIVED]\nlease 已过期" as EXPIRED #FFF4CC
state "FAILED_RETRYABLE\n[DERIVED]\n允许恢复" as FAILED_RETRYABLE #FFF4CC
state "FAILED_FINAL\n[DERIVED]\n不允许恢复" as FAILED_FINAL #FFF4CC

PROCESSING --> ACTIVE : [READ] now < processingExpireAt
PROCESSING --> EXPIRED : [READ] now >= processingExpireAt
FAILED --> FAILED_RETRYABLE : [READ] failureRetryable=true
FAILED --> FAILED_FINAL : [READ] failureRetryable=false

state "RETURN PROCESSING\n[CALL RESULT]" as RET_PROCESSING #FFFFFF
state "RETURN PROCESSING_EXPIRED\n[CALL RESULT]" as RET_EXPIRED #FFFFFF
state "RETURN PREVIOUS_FAILED_RETRYABLE\n[CALL RESULT]" as RET_FAILED_RETRYABLE #FFFFFF
state "RETURN PREVIOUS_FAILED_FINAL\n[CALL RESULT]" as RET_FAILED_FINAL #FFFFFF
state "REPLAYED\n[CALL RESULT]\n不重新执行业务" as REPLAYED #FFFFFF
state "PREVIOUS_DISCARDED\n[CALL RESULT]" as PREVIOUS_DISCARDED #FFFFFF

ACTIVE --> RET_PROCESSING : normal execute()
EXPIRED --> RET_EXPIRED : normal execute()\n不自动接管
FAILED_RETRYABLE --> RET_FAILED_RETRYABLE : normal execute()
FAILED_FINAL --> RET_FAILED_FINAL : normal execute()
SUCCESS --> REPLAYED : duplicate execute()
DISCARDED --> PREVIOUS_DISCARDED : duplicate execute()

state "RECOVERY_CANDIDATE\n[DOC ONLY]\n扫描候选" as REC_CANDIDATE #E8DDF5
state "TRY_RECOVER\n[ATOMIC]\nexpectedOwner + expectedVersion" as TRY_RECOVER #E8DDF5
state "RECOVERY_ACQUIRED\n[REPO RESULT]\nnew owner + version+1" as REC_ACQUIRED #E8DDF5
state "STALE_CANDIDATE\n[REPO RESULT]" as STALE #E8DDF5
state "RECOVERY_NOT_ALLOWED\n[CALL RESULT]" as REC_NOT_ALLOWED #FFFFFF
state "STALE_RECOVERY_CANDIDATE\n[CALL RESULT]" as STALE_RESULT #FFFFFF

EXPIRED --> REC_CANDIDATE : [RECOVERY] recoverProcessingTimeout=true
FAILED_RETRYABLE --> REC_CANDIDATE : [RECOVERY] recoverFailed=true
REC_CANDIDATE --> TRY_RECOVER : recover(expectedOwner, expectedVersion)
TRY_RECOVER --> REC_ACQUIRED : candidate 仍有效
TRY_RECOVER --> STALE : owner/version 已变化
TRY_RECOVER --> REC_NOT_ALLOWED : 不允许恢复 / 已终态
REC_ACQUIRED --> PROCESSING : [RECOVERY] 原子接管\nnew generation
STALE --> STALE_RESULT

state "WINDOW_ACTIVE\n[WINDOWED ONLY]" as WINDOW_ACTIVE #FFFFFF
state "WINDOW_EXPIRED\n[WINDOWED ONLY]" as WINDOW_EXPIRED #FFFFFF
state "NEXT_GENERATION\n[WINDOWED ONLY]\nversion+1" as NEXT_GENERATION #FFFFFF

SUCCESS --> WINDOW_ACTIVE : WINDOWED
FAILED --> WINDOW_ACTIVE : WINDOWED
DISCARDED --> WINDOW_ACTIVE : WINDOWED
WINDOW_ACTIVE --> WINDOW_ACTIVE : FIXED=不推进\nSLIDING=有效访问推进窗口
WINDOW_ACTIVE --> WINDOW_EXPIRED : now >= windowExpireAt
WINDOW_EXPIRED --> NEXT_GENERATION : next execute()
NEXT_GENERATION --> PROCESSING : 重置同一物理记录\n开启新 generation

note bottom of PROCESSING
真正持久状态只有：
PROCESSING / SUCCESS / FAILED / DISCARDED。
ACTIVE / EXPIRED / RETRYABLE / FINAL 都是派生判定。
end note

note bottom of REC_ACQUIRED
Recovery 不是第五个持久状态。
接管成功后仍回到 PROCESSING，只是 ownerToken 改变、version + 1。
end note

note bottom of WINDOW_EXPIRED
WINDOWED 的幂等语义到期，不等于物理记录立即删除。
recordRetentionTtl 可以继续保留旧记录。
end note

@enduml
